  "title": "Oil Free Malaysian Dates Noodles",
  "description": "A citrusy and crunchy Malaysian dish featuring pitted dates, perfect for a hangover cure, made with a pasta water emulsion and sugar free friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
